; TEST: abort=5
;
; `trap terminus` -- abort kind 5, `dum ... terminus N` entering its N+1th
; iteration (prelude/README.md's table; docs/design/lowering.md finding 2
; asked for it so the overrun stops folding into kind 1). The one trap kind
; word emit.inc's `__bfa_emit_trap` knows. Distinct from trap_add_carry.ir's
; kind 1: an emitter that routed every trap through the shared kind-1 stub
; passes that fixture and fails this one.

functio @initium (ptr) -> u64 {
b0:
%0 = param ptr 0
trap terminus
}
